interface_notes = "Bootstrap package references to remote-domain CLI/environment/file-format rows are static inventory references, not direct runtime calls. Ranking producer/HTTP/SDK and stream schemas and terminal route consumers were compared with actual counterpart shapes. Falling-change loser scores are nonnegative magnitudes under 4289.1. RankingsResponse permits the extra freshness field. Legacy development ranking routes remain distinct from production snapshots."
lifecycle_notes = "Production publication uses immutable artifacts, epoch fencing, transactional heads/outbox and api_stream source proofs; cursor/cache identity binds retained run and digests. The recorded count mismatch prevents that heavy path from completing. UI account reads use session transport; device preferences and recent pools are local state rather than network authority."
evidence_boundary = "This record reports source and interface review at the audited revision. It does not claim service, browser, database, broker or security suites executed, or that previously failed inventory commands were repaired."

